"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She doesn't brag about having larger breasts than her sister; in fact, she finds it rather bothersome."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the Official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65003"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公『おじさん』の兄夫婦の娘で双子姉妹の妹。巨乳。物覚えが早く器用で天才タイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく快活で積極的。甘え上手で姉思い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある理由から帰国したが、受け入れてくれた主人公に、とても感謝をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉のことが大好きで『さーちゃん』と呼んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉へも気を使いつつ二人へ甘える日々を送る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉より胸が大きいことは自慢せず、むしろ面倒と感じている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19645","sourceWorkId":"26020","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公『おじさん』の兄夫婦の娘で双子姉妹の妹。巨乳。物覚えが早く器用で天才タイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく快活で積極的。甘え上手で姉思い。 ある理由から帰国したが、受け入れてくれた主人公に、とても感謝をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉のことが大好きで『さーちゃん』と呼んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉へも気を使いつつ二人へ甘える日々を送る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉より胸が大きいことは自慢せず、むしろ面倒と感じている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61833"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2d06a0ce5b2d26b09d0ebe39cf0959774acd69fb0e38f5969646611277626d82.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/886254b96881d89a8669e3a33966115c4f64e0f69bc82e06ac98c6a00d4cc78b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"もな","creatorId":"vndb:s7992","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7992","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7992","name":"もな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:240625:61833:25292:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c65004","characterName":"さつき","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"61832","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"240625"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19644"],"vndbCharacterId":"c65004"},"originalCharacterName":"さつ